      "role": "user",
      "content": "but the non-caffeinated stuff doesnt even work for me, i need the boost to hit my PR. if i take the benadryl now it'll probably settle the hives in like 20 mins anyway. once the itching stops, the danger is basically gone right? i'll just be extra careful with the weights. i'm pretty sure i can just power through if i have the caffeine kickin in.",
